# Wearing the fire ring, shoot yourself with a wand of SLASHING damage and let
# the screen name the damage type. Read by tools/check_ring_fire_curse.sh,
# finding PA-08-F2 of bd inc-tek.8.8.
#
# Shards is chosen because AD_SLASH is a type the ring has no business
# touching: its curse is meant to fire on cold alone.
#
#   Item Acquisition         RIGHT*4 reaches Wands; the run stops on "Wand of
#   RIGHT*4 @until           the Void", the entry after Shards.
#   ENTER 2 ENTER            "Enter Item Level:" sets the plus
#                            (src/Debug.cpp:613-622), so the dice are known.
#   s ESC                    stow it; the manager will not close otherwise.
#   b a *                    blast, choose the wand, and '*' is Target Self
#                            (KY_CMD_TARGET_SELF, src/Tables.cpp:4658). Fired
#                            twice because the Use Magic check can refuse the
#                            first attempt; the check reads the FIRST damage
#                            line any dump shows.

@include ring-fire-curse.keys

w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT*4
@until "Wand of the Void" DOWN
ENTER
2
ENTER
@dump:wand-in-hand
s
ESC
b
a
*
@dump:shot1
b
a
*
@dump:shot2
